In this architecture, `models.py` serves as the central PyTorch neural network registry (`PlanetX_CNN`, `SpectralRNN`, `KinematicGNN`), `spherex_pipeline.py` acts as the master orchestrator, and each notebook cell has its own dedicated module inside `backend/server/` with zero duplicate code.

